I am A B C.

2822
03:01:18,446 --> 03:01:21,553
I am an Indian and I am third generation Saudi in Saudi Arabia.

2823
03:01:21,633 --> 03:01:24,869
Honestly, I think the weddings in my circle are the perfect mix.

2824
03:01:24,949 --> 03:01:27,594
We keep the desi culture and the Islamic traditions,

2825
03:01:27,674 --> 03:01:31,499
but there's also a bit of that simple intimate white wedding vibe.

2826
03:01:31,579 --> 03:01:35,506
Let me tell you about one I went to recently because it really stayed with me.

2827
03:01:35,586 --> 03:01:39,020
In December twenty twenty five, a family friend of mine got married.

2828
03:01:39,100 --> 03:01:40,530
I basically grew up with him.

2829
03:01:40,610 --> 03:01:42,050
He was raised in Saudi Arabia.

2830
03:01:42,130 --> 03:01:43,584
and doesn't have many cousins here.

2831
03:01:43,664 --> 03:01:45,960
But a few came from Canada and the UK.

2832
03:01:46,040 --> 03:01:50,013
His family went out of their way to arrange visas for the elders like his grandparents,

2833
03:01:50,093 --> 03:01:52,856
uncles and aunts, the people who deserve the most respect.

2834
03:01:52,936 --> 03:01:55,952
Everyone else just got an invite and whoever could make it made it.

2835
03:01:56,032 --> 03:02:01,014
And the funny thing is the Saudi visa system is so strict that a lot of his relatives just couldn't get visas.

2836
03:02:01,094 --> 03:02:07,278
Between us the family was secretly relieved because they didn't want a huge crowd of cousins anyway.

2837
03:02:07,358 --> 03:02:09,390
In the end only about 20 relatives showed up.

2838
03:02:09,470 --> 03:02:12,390
The whole wedding was around 150 to 180 people.

2839
03:02:12,470 --> 03:02:14,390
Men and women together.

2840
03:02:14,470 --> 03:02:18,390
And he made sure his friends and family friends outnumbered the relatives.

2841
03:02:18,470 --> 03:02:23,390
So it was mostly people who actually cared about him, including friends from his childhood.

2842
03:02:23,470 --> 03:02:25,390
One second, did I leave the car today?

2843
03:02:25,470 --> 03:02:27,390
No, the car is inside.

2844
03:02:27,470 --> 03:02:30,390
I don't know. When I came today, I also…

2845
03:02:30,470 --> 03:02:33,390
Yes, I don't know why I thought.

2846
03:02:33,470 --> 03:02:36,210
It felt so warm and what I really…

2847
03:02:36,290 --> 03:03:03,380
really liked is that most of the guests were actually the friends and of the bride and groom themselves not the friends of their parents so the room was full of people who genuinely knew the couple and were there for them what I loved is that everyone just listened before it started they asked everybody not to take pictures and I swear not a single person did they shared a dress code nothing too fancy and everyone followed it there was a separate kid section with babysitters hired to look after them and no one complained

2848
03:03:03,580 --> 03:03:08,940
Then there were speeches from the grandparents, uncles, aunts, parents and siblings of both sides.

2849
03:03:09,020 --> 03:03:10,659
And they got really emotional.

2850
03:03:10,739 --> 03:03:11,699
I gave a speech too.

2851
03:03:11,779 --> 03:03:14,925
He is not related to me by blood, but he is like a brother.

2852
03:03:15,005 --> 03:03:16,380
So yes, I got emotional too.

2853
03:03:16,460 --> 03:03:18,084
I even saw people crying.

2854
03:03:18,164 --> 03:03:21,129
Wait, I gave a speech once in someone's wedding.

2855
03:03:21,209 --> 03:03:24,051
So it was like a close friend who is American.

2856
03:03:24,131 --> 03:03:26,783
So she brought that tradition here.

2857
03:03:26,863 --> 03:03:29,890
So I was asked to say some nice things and I did.

2858
03:03:29,970 --> 03:03:31,020
It was very nice.

2859
03:03:32,100 --> 03:03:36,420
He's not related to me by blood, but he's always like a brother. So yes, I got emotional too.

2860
03:03:36,500 --> 03:03:41,300
I even saw people crying who barely met him, like one of his mother's friends.

2861
03:03:41,380 --> 03:03:44,940
Everyone was making dua from the bottom of their hearts.

2862
03:03:45,020 --> 03:03:50,620
And I remember thinking how lucky is this couple that so many people are praying for them so sincerely.

2863
03:03:50,700 --> 03:03:54,340
When the groom arrived, there was no car parade. Everyone just parked properly.

2864
03:03:54,420 --> 03:04:00,300
His best friend led everyone in Isha prayer and then the Nikkah happened.

2865
03:04:00,480 --> 03:04:08,320
The bride did spend a lot on her wedding dress from Pakistan because that's what she wanted but everything else was kept so simple.

2866
03:04:08,520 --> 03:04:10,158
The food was also my kind of food.

2867
03:04:10,238 --> 03:04:14,796
There was a bunch of salads, one mutton gravy, one chicken gravy, two chicken starters,

2868
03:04:14,876 --> 03:04:18,140
one biryani, one kind of naan and jalebi and kheer for dessert.

2869
03:04:18,970 --> 03:04:20,486
That's it and nobody wasted anything.

2870
03:04:20,566 --> 03:04:25,774
I couldn't finish one kebab so I wrapped it in a tissue and took it home and I saw many aunties doing the same thing.

2871
03:04:25,854 --> 03:04:27,890
Compare that to the wedding I have been.

2872
03:04:27,970 --> 03:04:32,525
I have been to in India 7 or 8 starters, a few chicken gravies, 3 or 4 mutton gravies,

2873
03:04:32,605 --> 03:04:35,130
2 types of biryani, halim and endless desserts.

2874
03:04:35,210 --> 03:04:36,734
You can't even taste everything.

2875
03:04:36,814 --> 03:04:39,401
Plus there's a lot of rush and pressure to attend.

2876
03:04:39,481 --> 03:04:43,430
So I'm honestly happy I don't live there and don't have to do all of them.

2877
03:04:43,790 --> 03:04:47,348
Everyone also respected each other's privacy and choices.

2878
03:04:47,428 --> 03:04:53,080
Women who wanted to wear hijab and abaya in front of men just did and nobody questioned.

2879
03:04:53,560 --> 03:04:56,560
