2892
03:05:54,850 --> 03:06:00,770
And then we all go to a restaurant and eat together. Honestly, even skipping the meal would be fine with me.

2893
03:06:00,850 --> 03:06:07,570
I feel there there's so much barakah in keeping things simple and I don't want to show off.

2894
03:06:07,650 --> 03:06:13,630
I don't even have Instagram and I don't use Snapchat and I'm still and I'll admit something cheeky.

2895
03:06:13,710 --> 03:06:19,630
I am secretly hoping there are visa issues when it's my turn so that a lot of my cousins can't come.

2896
03:06:19,710 --> 03:06:25,630
I know my parents will pressure me into inviting them because otherwise it would become a whole thing in the family.

2897
03:06:25,710 --> 03:06:29,630
My dad's eldest brother and my favorite aunt will definitely find their way here.

2898
03:06:29,710 --> 03:06:33,220
If anyone feels left out, maybe we can host a Dawat in India afterward,

2899
03:06:33,300 --> 03:06:36,956
