2900
03:06:37,036 --> 03:06:38,630
Lucknow and other parts of India.

2901
03:06:38,710 --> 03:06:40,710
So just picking a city would be a headache.

2902
03:06:42,540 --> 03:06:46,011
One more thing I really really love my community in Saudi Arabia.

2903
03:06:46,091 --> 03:06:51,123
People are genuine, nobody is two faced and everyone wishes well for each other.

2904
03:06:51,203 --> 03:06:54,246
I honestly haven't seen jealousy among the people I know.

2905
03:06:54,326 --> 03:06:58,438
They go out of their way to help each other and they respect your privacy.

2906
03:06:58,518 --> 03:07:01,188
If I don't want to share something, nobody pushes.

2907
03:07:01,268 --> 03:07:02,282
When I am in India,

2908
03:07:02,362 --> 03:07:06,928
people say things like you must be so alone there and I just think you have no idea.

2909
03:07:07,008 --> 03:07:08,209
We are not alone at all.

2910
03:07:08,289 --> 03:07:08,970
We have so many

2911
03:07:09,050 --> 03:07:10,879
so many people who truly care about us.

2912
03:07:10,959 --> 03:07:19,241
I know a family friend who passed away in a road accident and his kids chose to stay in Saudi Arabia with family friends instead of going back to India.

2913
03:07:19,321 --> 03:07:25,454
It's been thirteen years and all the family friends chip in to take care of them because we were friends with the parents.

2914
03:07:25,534 --> 03:07:28,423
That sums up the community for me, Alhamdulillah.

2915
03:07:28,503 --> 03:07:33,270
People also think there's nothing to do, but my weekends were always booked with parties,

2916
03:07:33,350 --> 03:07:34,231
