2917
03:07:34,311 --> 03:07:35,460
I'll tell you something funny.

2918
03:07:35,540 --> 03:07:38,460
I never once ate at a restaurant in Saudi Arabia.

2919
03:07:38,540 --> 03:07:47,960
My family never had time because we were always at gatherings and we tasted almost every Indian and Pakistani restaurant food through catering.

2920
03:07:48,040 --> 03:07:54,460
My first time actually sitting in a restaurant was when I came to India for college at nineteen.

2921
03:07:54,540 --> 03:08:00,460
A little background, my life, my family has been in Saudi Arabia since the 1940s.

2922
03:08:00,540 --> 03:08:03,250
My great grandfather was the one of the Mohsins.

2923
03:08:03,330 --> 03:08:04,330
in Medina, Mashallah.

2924
03:08:04,410 --> 03:08:07,011
And when he retired, my grandfather worked there.

2925
03:08:07,091 --> 03:08:11,031
My dad was born in India, but went to Saudi Arabia very young.

2926
03:08:11,111 --> 03:08:12,912
Worked there and then we were born.

2927
03:08:12,992 --> 03:08:17,754
I love my life there so much and I really hope I never have to move back to India for good.

2928
03:08:17,834 --> 03:08:22,484
The noise, the air pollution and the chaos of the cities honestly scares me.

2929
03:08:22,564 --> 03:08:24,159
If I ever had to live in India,

2930
03:08:24,239 --> 03:08:28,972
I'd pick a village over a city any day with houses far apart and nobody around who knows me.

2931
03:08:29,052 --> 03:08:30,890
That kind of mental peace.

2932
03:08:31,300 --> 03:08:35,620
is so nice. The job market for expats in Saudi Arabia is tough though.

2933
03:08:35,700 --> 03:08:42,120
So please pray that I get a job. Anyway, thank you for making videos that start conversations like this.

2934
03:08:42,200 --> 03:08:48,620
I'd love to hear what you think and whether you've seen weddings like this in your own circle as well.

2935
03:08:48,700 --> 03:08:54,120
Very nice, very heartwarming. Thank you so much for your lovely email and

2936
03:08:54,200 --> 03:08:57,900
what you presented with Manzar Kashi, it felt.

2937
03:08:59,440 --> 03:09:04,440
By the way, life in the Middle East is amazing man. I can't stress this enough. There's not.

2938
03:09:05,150 --> 03:09:07,358
Anyway, I'm living with that family.

2939
03:09:07,438 --> 03:09:12,360
So like, see, living with a job person and a family is very different.

2940
03:09:12,440 --> 03:09:14,465
Now, what is family to family,

2941
03:09:14,545 --> 03:09:18,113
what are your relationships or what are your relations with Arabs,

2942
03:09:18,193 --> 03:09:20,360
what are your relations with locals, etc.

2943
03:09:20,440 --> 03:09:23,360
But overall, life is very peaceful. Do you miss Doha?

2944
03:09:23,440 --> 03:09:25,900
Yes, brother. Right? Life is great.

2945
03:09:25,980 --> 03:09:29,900
Yeah, it's very quiet. No nonsense.

2946
03:09:29,980 --> 03:09:32,900
I was just watching the story of Azlan.

2947
03:09:32,980 --> 03:09:38,900
At 3.30 am, next to his apartment, there is a bungalow being sold and someone is building a building there.

2948
03:09:38,980 --> 03:09:42,900
At 3.30 am, the excavator is drilling.

2949
03:09:42,980 --> 03:09:47,900
And no one is asking. He lives in a decent area. It is near the Mazar-e-Qaid.

2950
03:09:47,980 --> 03:09:50,900
I mean, you know, upper middle class.

2951
03:09:50,980 --> 03:09:52,980
Can this happen in Doha?

2952
03:09:53,560 --> 03:10:02,480
There will be only one such opposition that will fill generations.

2953
03:10:02,560 --> 03:10:07,480
So this thing is amazing in Middle East. The food is amazing.

2954
03:10:07,560 --> 03:10:11,480
Look, the weather is fine now, you can't have your cake and eat it.

2955
03:10:11,560 --> 03:10:18,480
So the sound of the call to prayer comes, you know, it's very culturally enriching.

2956
03:10:18,560 --> 03:10:21,470
I would gladly live in the Middle East.

2957
03:10:21,550 --> 03:10:25,741
but now the situation is like that, so the way you shared it, I totally get it,

2958
03:10:25,821 --> 03:10:30,012
and the fact that you went to a restaurant for the first time when you were 19,

2959
03:10:30,092 --> 03:10:33,022
this also had possibly has to do with the family,

2960
03:10:33,102 --> 03:10:38,329
I'm not saying that before Saudi Arabia opened up, women didn't go to restaurants,

2961
03:10:38,409 --> 03:10:41,017
obviously they would have gone before,

2962
03:10:41,097 --> 03:10:45,760
but as you said that everything happens in family gatherings, so it was never needed,

2963
03:10:45,840 --> 03:10:47,890
so you probably have like a large family and

2964
03:10:47,970 --> 03:10:51,890
and then like you know all the things are happening among family.

2965
03:10:51,970 --> 03:10:58,890
So, what you wrote that I loved most about this wedding was it was actually about the bride and groom.

2966
03:10:58,970 --> 03:11:04,890
Here it's the opposite. The one who gets married is the least important.

2967
03:11:04,970 --> 03:11:09,890
Here the most important are the elder mother, elder grandmother, elder grandfather, elder this, elder that, elder uncle.

2968
03:11:09,970 --> 03:11:11,970
They should be happy.

2969
03:11:14,370 --> 03:11:18,290
I have rarely seen that the bride and groom themselves are enjoying their wedding.

2970
03:11:18,370 --> 03:11:25,290
It's always about the upkeep, it's always about parents or their business associates or their distant relatives.

2971
03:11:25,370 --> 03:11:30,290
I mean, if you gather 500,000 people, but that essence is not there.

2972
03:11:30,370 --> 03:11:36,290
And those relatives whom you haven't spoken to for 15 years, your wedding must have been connected to them.

2973
03:11:36,370 --> 03:11:39,290
Oh, brother, these two people have to be connected here.

2974
03:11:39,370 --> 03:11:42,280
But that marriage will be that yes, I have been talking to aunt Razia for 15 years.

2975
03:11:42,360 --> 03:11:44,280
So this time she will come to the wedding.

2976
03:11:44,360 --> 03:11:46,280
There are father and aunt crying standing there.

2977
03:11:46,360 --> 03:11:48,280
Now a wedding is taking place here and there is a separate emo session.

2978
03:11:48,360 --> 03:11:51,280
You must have seen so much, I have also seen a lot.

2979
03:11:51,360 --> 03:11:52,680
Anger ends.

2980
03:11:57,820 --> 03:12:01,100
Marriage is for him but I'll make it about myself.

2981
03:12:02,020 --> 03:12:04,940
So, those aunts are getting married, uncles and aunts are hugging each other,

2982
03:12:05,020 --> 03:12:09,020
there's a different emotional drama going on, the groom and bride are sitting here, eating rabri.

2983
03:12:09,900 --> 03:12:15,020
So, keep it about the one who has a day, in the funeral and in the wedding.

2984
03:12:15,100 --> 03:12:17,020
Today only two emails came.

2985
03:12:17,100 --> 03:12:23,740
And, like I said, the least important people are the same, the most tired poor people are the same.

2986
03:12:23,870 --> 03:12:25,790
They are under a lot of pressure.

2987
03:12:25,870 --> 03:12:28,790
So, yes, they go home and sleep.

2988
03:12:28,870 --> 03:12:30,790
I think so.

2989
03:12:30,870 --> 03:12:35,790
And then the involvement, that means, you have to make a guest list with the parents.

2990
03:12:35,870 --> 03:12:38,790
The child has no control over who is coming and who is not coming.

2991
03:12:38,870 --> 03:12:40,790
How will the entry be?

2992
03:12:40,870 --> 03:12:42,790
Someone or the other is ruining it.

2993
03:12:42,870 --> 03:12:44,790
Some aunt walks ahead and leaves.

2994
03:12:44,870 --> 03:12:46,870
On purpose. There are a lot of dramas, man.

2995
03:12:50,060 --> 03:12:55,233
And the marriages we have, it's not about celebration of a relationship,

2996
03:12:55,313 --> 03:12:59,780
it's more about showing off how much money you have invested.

2997
03:12:59,860 --> 03:13:03,780
So it's all about financial standing, let alone about celebration.

2998
03:13:03,860 --> 03:13:07,780
Like I said, the easiest thing is to get married if you want to.

2999
03:13:07,860 --> 03:13:10,780
But no, everyone is a bug.

3000
03:13:10,860 --> 03:13:15,740
So you will go into debt and you go. It's the easiest thing.

3001
03:13:15,820 --> 03:13:20,600
Four people gather, go to the mosque, go to Kailashi, eat and come home.

3002
03:13:20,680 --> 03:13:22,600
There is nothing easier than this in the world.

3003
03:13:22,680 --> 03:13:24,600
And this is the most difficult thing.

3004
03:13:24,680 --> 03:13:28,800
The rest is in front of you. Why? Because we live for others.

3005
03:13:28,880 --> 03:13:32,300
We have to show our faces to others. What others will think, what others will do.

3006
03:13:32,380 --> 03:13:38,980
When others are your brother, when you are in the hospital, you are paying the bill, no one else will pay the bill for you.

3007
03:13:43,200 --> 03:13:47,580
Put the one who is with you in sadness, who is with you in your bad times.

3008
03:13:47,920 --> 03:13:54,780
You haven't talked for 15 years, you have held them tight, they are also angry, sitting, strange, strange environment.

3009
03:13:54,860 --> 03:13:59,980
I am not saying every marriage is like this. Some are really good, very wholesome, very nice, etc.

3010
03:14:00,320 --> 03:14:03,970
But overall you know everything how it is.

3011
03:14:07,820 --> 03:14:13,740
It's not about respect, it's about the kids and their wishes.

3012
03:14:13,820 --> 03:14:17,740
It's about the kids, they want to celebrate in their own way.

3013
03:14:17,820 --> 03:14:21,740
There's no autonomy. Everything is up to the parents.

3014
03:14:21,820 --> 03:14:27,740
And like you said about the food, 2-4 curries, 1 starter and 8 desserts.

3015
03:14:27,820 --> 03:14:29,740
It's completely reasonable.

3016
03:14:29,820 --> 03:14:32,820
Now here, there are 36 dishes and they're being wasted.

3017
03:14:34,140 --> 03:14:36,580
We don't want to do it. So…

3018
03:14:38,840 --> 03:14:51,760
and the way you have written your clothing choice was respected, that's also a nice thing.

3019
03:14:51,840 --> 03:14:59,670
Because a wedding invitation shouldn't come with a pressure that you have to dress a certain way,

3020
03:14:59,750 --> 03:15:04,530
it should be respected how you want to appear and it's nice.

3021
03:15:06,650 --> 03:15:07,761
and that makes it good.

3022
03:15:07,841 --> 03:15:08,411
Experience.

3023
03:15:08,491 --> 03:15:10,822
And when you talked about gifts, in this too,

3024
03:15:10,902 --> 03:15:15,488
like I've spoken a lot about before that some people already put a list, put a QR code,

3025
03:15:15,568 --> 03:15:17,225
that these things have happened,

3026
03:15:17,305 --> 03:15:20,986
Google sheet is there and then you just contribute towards it.

3027
03:15:21,066 --> 03:15:25,784
Like in this, because he had to live at his parents' house for a while before migrating,

3028
03:15:25,864 --> 03:15:29,829
so when there is a fridge, TV, microwave, everything at the parents' house,

3029
03:15:29,909 --> 03:15:31,877
then what is the need for another one?

3030
03:15:31,957 --> 03:15:32,550
Why pressure?

3031
03:15:32,630 --> 03:15:32,930
Why?

3032
03:15:33,010 --> 03:15:34,410
Yes, you have to have small things.

3033
03:15:34,490 --> 03:15:38,410
You can buy things you want. And that is good.

3034
03:15:38,490 --> 03:15:41,410
It doesn't waste things.

3035
03:15:41,490 --> 03:15:43,410
Like I told you last time, crystal set.

3036
03:15:43,490 --> 03:15:47,410
Every person is buying a crystal set from Gul Plaza. Former.

3037
03:15:47,490 --> 03:15:50,410
So things are not wasted.

3038
03:15:50,490 --> 03:15:55,410
It's not thrown away. And it's more practical and less financially burdensome.

3039
03:15:55,490 --> 03:15:58,410
You know, burdening. Sorry, what is burdensome?

3040
03:15:58,490 --> 03:16:02,490
So, the rest of what you said that you want to do a small Nikkah in Madina.

3041
03:16:02,680 --> 03:16:05,791
and you want people to not get visas,

3042
03:16:05,871 --> 03:16:09,697
I would not suggest that if this is a new step in your life,

3043
03:16:09,777 --> 03:16:12,400
then you start it with a negative feeling.

3044
03:16:12,480 --> 03:16:15,400
I do understand your concerns and I am totally with you on that.

3045
03:16:15,480 --> 03:16:17,613
But pray that they don't get visas.

3046
03:16:17,693 --> 03:16:19,160
Don't invite them beforehand.

3047
03:16:19,240 --> 03:16:23,400
You can already do this that we are only doing it among fifty people, very simply.

3048
03:16:23,480 --> 03:16:25,400
Or between fifteen people or twenty, thirty people.

3049
03:16:25,480 --> 03:16:29,480
And we will come again and we will visit every city.

3050
03:16:29,580 --> 03:16:32,000
Like you said, they are scattered in 6 cities.

3051
03:16:32,080 --> 03:16:36,000
So, gathering everyone in one city can be quite costly.

3052
03:16:36,080 --> 03:16:39,000
You, two husband and wife and two parents,

3053
03:16:39,080 --> 03:16:42,000
go to every city, everyone is nearby,

3054
03:16:42,080 --> 03:16:48,000
so go there one day, one day there, one day there, and greet them in their city and come back.

3055
03:16:48,080 --> 03:16:50,000
That would be the best part.

3056
03:16:50,080 --> 03:16:50,380
So,

3057
03:16:50,460 --> 03:16:57,127
and this thing that the assumption is that you are alone in Saudi and you live a boring life,

3058
03:16:57,207 --> 03:16:57,707
this…

3059
03:16:57,900 --> 03:17:02,320
Again, because your life is bad, how can someone else's life be good?

3060
03:17:02,400 --> 03:17:07,820
So, you have to find the bugs in it without knowing anything about how life is there.

3061
03:17:07,900 --> 03:17:13,820
Look, their road is empty. Yes, it is 50 degrees centigrade, there is something crazy standing outside.

3062
03:17:13,900 --> 03:17:20,320
But there are gatherings in houses, people sit, meet, they have a proper life, proper celebrations.

3063
03:17:20,400 --> 03:17:24,950
You know, outing in the desert, they live very, they are Bedouins, they know how to live.

3064
03:17:25,030 --> 03:17:26,950
They have been living like that for thousands of years.

3065
03:17:27,030 --> 03:17:29,950
But they are the ones who are dying of their own insecurity.

3066
03:17:30,030 --> 03:17:31,950
You must be bored there.

3067
03:17:32,030 --> 03:17:34,950
People think this chaos is life.

3068
03:17:35,030 --> 03:17:43,960
This chaos, traffic, noise, air quality, people from here to there, crowded rush,

3069
03:17:44,040 --> 03:17:44,950
this is life.

3070
03:17:45,030 --> 03:17:47,950
And that calmness is not life.

3071
03:17:48,030 --> 03:17:52,030
It is a graveyard atmosphere.

3072
03:17:52,770 --> 03:17:57,464
Not everyone wants noise, not everyone wants chaos, I like orderly things,

3073
03:17:57,544 --> 03:18:02,675
I like crooked things, I mean you can't walk straight on any footpath in Karachi,

3074
03:18:02,755 --> 03:18:08,411
in any market, there's always a stone, there's always a hole, there's always a pit,

3075
03:18:08,491 --> 03:18:12,299
there's always something, you can't walk straight,

3076
03:18:12,379 --> 03:18:17,135
you can't just walk with your back bent, this will keep going.

3077
03:18:17,215 --> 03:18:19,140
So some people don't like that life.

3078
03:18:19,220 --> 03:18:24,620
So why should they put their insecurity on you?

3079
03:18:24,700 --> 03:18:27,780
So don't listen to such people.

3080
03:18:27,860 --> 03:18:31,620
And like you said that you don't wish to live in India, that's perfectly your choice.

3081
03:18:31,700 --> 03:18:33,700
The whole world is yours.

3082
03:18:33,960 --> 03:18:38,418
And any country's passport or now you inherently got India's passport,

3083
03:18:38,498 --> 03:18:41,580
so now it's not necessary for you to stay there.

3084
03:18:41,740 --> 03:18:43,740
Wherever you go, that's home.

3085
03:18:44,470 --> 03:18:50,390
Passport, ID card, ration card, or what card is that?

3086
03:18:50,470 --> 03:18:52,390
Aadhar card.

3087
03:18:52,470 --> 03:18:55,390
It doesn't determine. I mean, okay, legally it does.

3088
03:18:55,470 --> 03:18:57,390
But like home is where the heart is.

3089
03:18:57,470 --> 03:19:01,390
They say, if you have a heart in Saudi Arabia, then that is your home.

3090
03:19:01,470 --> 03:19:03,390
That's it.

3091
03:19:03,470 --> 03:19:06,390
You don't have to live in the Modi government or the Congress government.

3092
03:19:06,470 --> 03:19:11,470
You don't have to live in NCR, in this much pollution, air quality, fifteen hundred. You don't have to.

3093
03:19:11,610 --> 03:19:12,530
You don't wish to.

3094
03:19:12,610 --> 03:19:15,530
Humans should have freedom.

3095
03:19:15,610 --> 03:19:18,530
And there's nothing wrong in pursuing your own preferences.

3096
03:19:18,610 --> 03:19:20,530
Someone may have a desire to go to cities.

3097
03:19:20,610 --> 03:19:23,530
Like I personally don't have a desire to go to the mountains.

3098
03:19:23,610 --> 03:19:25,530
Okay. I like it.

3099
03:19:25,610 --> 03:19:29,530
But if I say that no, you will not have a life that lives in Skardu.

3100
03:19:29,610 --> 03:19:31,530
How can this be possible?

3101
03:19:31,610 --> 03:19:33,530
His life is that, mine is this life.

3102
03:19:33,610 --> 03:19:37,610
So, putting your will on someone else is a very Talibanized level.

3103
03:19:37,770 --> 03:19:39,690
level of thinking. Don't think like that.

3104
03:19:39,770 --> 03:19:43,690
What I like is my choice, what he likes is his choice.

3105
03:19:43,770 --> 03:19:47,690
How easy it is, if you want to learn the fundamentals of life, but no.

3106
03:19:47,770 --> 03:19:52,690
What I like, you should also be the same. Why should it be? It can't be.

3107
03:19:52,770 --> 03:19:57,690
We are all made different. We have different tastes. We have different acquired tastes.

3108
03:19:57,770 --> 03:20:03,770
We like different kinds of music, different kinds of food, different kinds of people, different kinds of environment.

3109
03:20:04,160 --> 03:20:05,080
Simple things.

3110
03:20:05,160 --> 03:20:06,080
So yes.

3111
03:20:06,160 --> 03:20:09,760
I'm glad you had this wonderful experience and you shared it with us.

3112
03:20:09,840 --> 03:20:10,760
Very wholesome.

3113
03:20:10,840 --> 03:20:18,680
I'm sure a lot of people can relate to it and I'm sure a lot of people aspire to attend such an intimate event.

3114
03:20:18,760 --> 03:20:23,600
I would also love to join something like that which is quiet and less people and you know.

3115
03:20:31,198 --> 03:20:33,118
You have to give your face.

3116
03:20:33,198 --> 03:20:37,118
So don't be like this. Go from your heart wherever you go and enjoy life.

3117
03:20:37,198 --> 03:20:40,118
